              "id": "JvDgC",
              "x": 22,
              "y": 20,
              "name": "Safety card title",
              "fill": "#172544",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 550,
              "content": "Existing runtime; preserved gates",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "UVRHB",
              "x": 22,
              "y": 56,
              "name": "Safety rules",
              "fill": "#53647f",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 550,
              "content": "Modes select existing Workspace views; no second runtime or agent.\nBrowserRuntime, Task Runtime, DecisionService, and failure repair stay in use.\nThe test runner owns PASS/FAIL; AI does not decide outcomes.\nRepair stays preview → explicit human approval → separate verification.\nExternal writes remain preview-first; no unattended loop.",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "gk8ad",
          "x": 688,
          "y": 530,
          "name": "Browser and automated acceptance",
          "width": 688,
          "height": 270,
          "fill": "#ffffff",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "stroke": "#dce3ef",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "none",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "uJgF7",
              "x": 22,
              "y": 20,
              "name": "Acceptance card title",
              "fill": "#172544",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 640,
              "content": "Verified locally with isolated services",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "SEc6z",
              "x": 22,
              "y": 56,
              "name": "Acceptance evidence",
              "fill": "#53647f",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 640,
              "content": "Manual Chrome 150 · 1440×900 / 1280×800 / 390×844 · no document overflow.\nAxe: 0 violations on Workspace Repair, mobile Workspace, project-create, and Worker-error views. One mobile-nav contrast check remained incomplete because an element was obscured.\nChecks: 192 web tests, typecheck, ESLint, build, Ruff, and i18n (26 namespaces / 3314 keys).\nEvidence: .ai-runs/2026-10-25-adaptive-workspace/evidence/screenshots/",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "OuJg5",
          "x": 64,
          "y": 824,
          "name": "Visual parity and browser blocker",
          "width": 1312,
          "height": 246,
          "fill": "#ffffff",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "stroke": "#dce3ef",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "none",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cksEF",
              "x": 22,
              "y": 18,
              "name": "Parity note title",
              "fill": "#586a87",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1260,
              "content": "VISUAL PARITY & BROWSER LIMITS",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qAI6n",
              "x": 22,
              "y": 48,
              "name": "Parity note",
              "fill": "#53647f",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1260,
              "content": "The Debug concept shows editor and browser side by side; shipped Debug selects the existing debugger/results view, while Browser remains an existing Workspace view. Pixel parity is not claimed.\nThe isolated Playwright E2E was blocked because the Playwright 1.62 Chromium executable is absent. agent-browser's bundled Chrome 155 cannot launch on macOS 12.7.6; browser dependencies were not installed.\nThe original four frames remain concepts only. Live screenshots and test logs are stored under .ai-runs/2026-10-25-adaptive-workspace/evidence/.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
